** ------------------------------------------------------------------------
** Grip-width sensitivity study: identical to ../dogbone_neohooke_sweep_300pct.inp
** (compressible NeoHooke, linear C3D8UL, 3D one-layer hex mesh), except the
** Dirichlet grip clamp now covers the outer 20 mm of each end (x<=-37.5 or
** x>=37.5) instead of 10 mm -- deep enough to reach into the fillet, not
** just the flat 25 mm-wide grip block. Kept alongside (not replacing) the
** original 10 mm-clamp results for direct comparison.
**
** Free (grip-to-grip) length is therefore 75 mm (2*37.5), not 95 mm. The
** right grip is ramped from 0 to 225 mm = 300% nominal strain on THIS
** 75 mm free length, so the two studies are compared at matching nominal
** strain, not matching absolute displacement.
**
** nominal strain := (U_gripRight - U_gripLeft) / 75.0   [75 mm free length]
** ------------------------------------------------------------------------

*include, input=../../../meshes/dogbone_mesh_3d_grip20.inp

*material, name=COMPRESSIBLENEOHOOKE, id=steellike
** K [MPa], G [MPa]  (E=210000, nu=0.47)
1166666.7, 71428.6

*section, name=section1, material=steellike, type=solid
all

*job, name=dogboneGrip20SweepNu047, domain=3d
*solver, solver=NIST, name=theSolver
linsolver=pardiso

*fieldOutput
>>perNode, nSet=gripClampLeft, field=displacement, result=U, name=U_gripLeft
>>perNode, nSet=gripClampRight, field=displacement, result=U, name=U_gripRight
>>perNode, nSet=gaugeLeftEdge, field=displacement, result=U, name=U_gaugeLeft
>>perNode, nSet=gaugeRightEdge, field=displacement, result=U, name=U_gaugeRight

*output, type=monitor
fieldOutput=U_gripLeft, f(x)='mean(x[:,0])'
*output, type=monitor
fieldOutput=U_gripRight, f(x)='mean(x[:,0])'
*output, type=monitor
fieldOutput=U_gaugeLeft, f(x)='mean(x[:,0])'
*output, type=monitor
fieldOutput=U_gaugeRight, f(x)='mean(x[:,0])'

*step, solver=theSolver
maxInc=0.01, minInc=1e-7, maxNumInc=2000, maxIter=40, criticalIter=8, stepLength=1.0
>>dirichlet, name=gripLeft,  nSet=gripClampLeft,  field=displacement, 1=0.0,   2=0.0
>>dirichlet, name=gripRight, nSet=gripClampRight, field=displacement, 1=225.0, 2=0.0
>>dirichlet, name=z0,        nSet=z0Layer,        field=displacement, 3=0.0
